<speak>It's encouraging that the family has noticed your effort. You don't have to make it perfect to make it useful. On our side, arranging a dedicated telephone slot can help keep banking administration within a defined part of the day. If a future call is likely to need papers, we can indicate that when setting the appointment, without putting sensitive content into a reminder. That gives you a chance to sit somewhere quiet, rather than trying to remember where everything is while we're already speaking.</speak>